2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Deploying\040metaheuristics\040for\040global\040optimization)
/Author (M\056\040Davarynejad)
/Subject (The\040complexity\040of\040large\055scale\040mechanical\040optimization\040problems\040is\040partially\040due\040to\040the\040presence\040of\040high\055dimensional\040design\040variables\054\040the\040interdependence\040among\040design\040variables\054\040and\040the\040high\040computational\040cost\040of\040the\040finite\040element\040simulations\040needed\040to\040evaluate\040the\040fitness\040of\040candidate\040solutions\056\040Evolutionary\040cycles\040are\040ruled\040by\040competitive\040games\040of\040survival\040and\040not\040merely\040by\040absolute\040measures\040of\040fitness\054\040as\040well\040as\040exploiting\040the\040robustness\040of\040evolution\040against\040uncertainties\040in\040the\040fitness\040function\040evaluations\056\040This\040chapter\040takes\040up\040the\040complexity\040challenge\040of\040mechanical\040optimization\040problems\040by\040proposing\040a\040new\040fitness\040granulation\040approach\040that\040attempts\040to\040cope\040with\040many\040difficulties\040of\040fitness\040approximation\040approaches\040that\040have\040been\040reported\040in\040the\040literature\056\040The\040approach\040is\040based\040on\040adaptive\040fuzzy\040fitness\040granulation\040having\040as\040its\040main\040aim\040to\040strike\040a\040balance\040between\040the\040accuracy\040and\040the\040utility\040of\040the\040computations\056\040The\040adaptation\040algorithm\040adjusts\040the\040radials\040of\040influence\040of\040granules\040according\040to\040the\040perceived\040performance\040and\040level\040of\040convergence\040attained\056\040Experimental\040results\040show\040that\040the\040proposed\040approach\040accelerates\040the\040convergence\040towards\040optimal\040solutions\054\040when\040compared\040to\040the\040performance\040of\040other\040more\040popular\040approaches\056\0401This\040chapter\040is\040based\040on\072\040\200\040M\056\040Davarynejad\054\040J\056\040Vrancken\054\040J\056\040van\040den\040Berg\054\040and\040C\056\040A\056\040Coello\040Coello\054\040\215A\040Fitness\040Granulation\040Approach\040for\040Large\055Scale\040Mechanical\040Optimization\040Problems\216\054\040In\040Raymond\040Chiong\040and\040Zbigniew\040Michalewicz\040\050Eds\056\051\054\040Variants\040of\040Evolutionary\040Algorithms\040for\040Real\055World\040Applications\054\040pp\056\040245\055280\054\040Springer\054\040Berlin\054\0402012\056\040\050ISBN\040978\0553\055642\05523423\0551\051)
/Keywords (18\040Jun\0402014\054\040Fitness\040approximation\054\040Fitness\040function\054\040Evolutionary\040algorithm\054\040Metaheuristic\054\040Optimization\040problem)
>>
endobj
